    "0": {
        "38_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, are you here on behalf of the Hakurei Shrine...?"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hey, you're rocking green too, nice! We're like sisters!"
            ]
        },
        "46_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Another shrine...how did this happen? They can't just spawn in.",
                "Also uh...I don't really...need a sister?"
            ]
        },
        "54_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Aw, that's a shame. Anyways, welcome to the Moriya Shrine."
            ]
        },
        "62_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It and the lake up ahead were both transported",
                "into Gensokyo from the outside world."
            ]
        },
        "70_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The outside world?? Did you guys befall the same fate as me?",
                "Wait...a whole lake?! That's insane!"
            ]
        },
        "78_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Don't worry about it. Since you're a fellow outsider,",
                "I'm sure you'll understand me."
            ]
        },
        "86_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The faith in Gensokyo has gone out of control afterall..."
            ]
        },
        "94_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yeah because of you lot! You can't just plop a new shrine here",
                "and expect the faith to remain normal! That's crazy talk!"
            ]
        },
        "102_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm more spiritually inclined than you are."
            ]
        },
        "110_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You might have gathered alot of faith somehow,",
                "but you don't understand what it really is about."
            ]
        },
        "118_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Usually faith only befalls gods and youkai."
            ]
        },
        "126_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Nevermind how I got it, that's totally irrelevant now.",
                "You don't touch my shrine, and you don't mess with the flow of faith!"
            ]
        },
        "134_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm Sanae, a wind priestess, descendent of a long-forgotten line of",
                "gods incarnate in the outside world."
            ]
        },
        "142_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I also want my shrine to prosper,",
                "so I guess we're at odds here."
            ]
        },
        "150_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I guess its time to see which of us is more green.",
                "You'll be forever my Player 2!"
            ]
        },
        "158_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh my god, you're a dweeb..."
            ]
        },
        "166_0": {
            "lines": [
                "No way in hell I'll lose to a nerd like you!"
            ]
        },
        "174_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I see. Then, maybe you should watch and consider the power of a",
                "living god..."
            ]
        },
        "182_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The divine power to work miracles!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "1": {
        "30_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're strong..."
            ]
        },
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You weren't even shaken by my awesome moves..."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I can't believe you'd bombard me with such old references."
            ]
        },
        "46_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Huh? What do you mean old?",
                "They're still pretty new, right?"
